    {
      "id": "99ef6cd3c000d2c667365ffc48777e80dc6a79d3",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 603139688,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hello @AndersBroman , Could you help to review this MR?\n\nBTW, the reason changing\n```c\ngrpc_module = prefs_register_protocol(proto_grpc, proto_reg_handoff_grpc);\n```\n to \n```c\ngrpc_module = prefs_register_protocol(proto_grpc, NULL);\n```\nis that !2925 make the proto_reg_handoff_grpc() need not to be invoked when preferences changed. And if proto_reg_handoff_grpc() be invoked when grpc preferences changed, the `dissector_add_for_decode_as_with_preference(\"tcp.port\", grpc_handle)` will be invoked again that will cause crash.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7308371,
            "username": "huangqiangxiong",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Huang Qiangxiong",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c2bf2741aa508a5655041b982730614ec30bfb908b83b47a8b3479a955123d80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/huangqiangxiong"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-06-16T15:44:22.771Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-06-16T15:45:12.202Z",
