        {
          "id": 622636274,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Because grpc dissector need some http2 headers (for example, content-type, grpc-encoding and ':path').\nIf 'decode as GRPC' directly, there are not enough information, we had to call http2 dissector, and let http2 dissector to call grpc dissector when get enough information.",
